WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.207
The Wu Yau conjecture, disproved.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.417
In one complex dimension, pinched negative curvature

3
00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:07.661
forces the disc. What about higher?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.175
A tube domain with a tuned potential

5
00:00:11.175 --> 00:00:13.210
stays negative, yet escapes every bound.

6
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.518
Claimed: contractible, negatively curved, yet not bounded.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.946
Checked in Lean.
